{"sections":[{"slug":"拟紧概形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"拟紧概形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟紧概形</span>"},"subject":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/代数几何","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数几何</span>"}}]},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"拟紧概形"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">若以下等价条件成立</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称之为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">拟紧</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的底层拓扑空间满足任何开覆盖有有限子覆盖</span>;</li>\n<li>$X$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有一个有限的仿射开覆盖</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">拟紧概形的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/相对","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">相对</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">版本是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟紧态射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟紧态射</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}